Data license
============

Flight data: adsb.lol
---------------------
The aircraft position data used in this project comes from adsb.lol (https://adsb.lol), via its daily
archives on GitHub (https://github.com/adsblol/globe_history_2026). adsb.lol makes this data available under
the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Derived database: public/bundle.npz
-----------------------------------
public/bundle.npz is a derived database produced from the adsb.lol data (per-minute aircraft positions over
North America, per-minute airborne counts, and detected takeoffs and landings, for Nov. 6-8 and Nov. 12-15,
2026). It is released under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

It can be regenerated from the original adsb.lol archives with the code in this repository
(scripts/download.sh and scripts/update_snapshot.sh). Any public use of this database or of works produced
from it must attribute adsb.lol and keep derived databases under the ODbL 1.0.

The session file __marimo__/session/grounded.py.json contains outputs computed from the same data and is
covered by the same terms.

Other data
----------
The snapshot also includes, or the notebook uses, data from these sources, each under its own terms:
- Aircraft registrations and types: tar1090-db, https://github.com/wiedehopf/tar1090-db
- Airports: OurAirports, https://ourairports.com/data/
- Country and state borders: Natural Earth via world-atlas and us-atlas, https://github.com/topojson
- En-route center outlines: VATSpy data project, https://github.com/vatsimnetwork/vatspy-data-project
